    {
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "SkynetLabs <waseem@skynetlabsai.com>",
        "toEmail": "={{ $('Validate').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "Your n8n workflow library access",
        "emailFormat": "both",
        "text": "Hi,\n\nYou're in. Here's where the n8n workflow library lives:\n\n- GitHub (importable JSON, MIT, free): https://github.com/waseemnasir2k26/n8n-workflows\n- Library page (latest workflows + the video behind each one): https://workflows.skynetjoe.com\n\nHow it works: every automation I build on YouTube gets published as an n8n workflow JSON you can import in under a minute. New workflow every video. Nothing sold, nothing gated behind a course.\n\nReply to this email with the automation you want built next.\n\nWaseem Nasir\nSkynetLabs\nhttps://skynetjoe.com\n\nTo stop these emails, reply \"stop\".\n",
        "html": "<div\n  style=\"\n    font-family: Inter, Arial, sans-serif;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    line-height: 1.6;\n    color: #1a1a1a;\n    background: #f2efe6;\n    padding: 32px 20px;\n  \"\n>\n  <div\n    style=\"\n      max-width: 560px;\n      margin: 0 auto;\n      background: #faf7f0;\n      border: 1px solid #ede8dc;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      padding: 28px 24px;\n    \"\n  >\n    <p\n      style=\"\n        margin: 0 0 8px;\n        font-family: &quot;IBM Plex Mono&quot;, Consolas, monospace;\n        font-size: 12px;\n        letter-spacing: 0.14em;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        color: #a8451f;\n      \"\n    >\n      Skynet_Labs_ &middot; n8n workflow library\n    </p>\n    <h1 style=\"margin: 0 0 16px; font-size: 24px; line-height: 1.2\">\n      You're in.\n    </h1>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 16px\">Here's where the library lives:</p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 8px\">\n      <a\n        href=\"https://github.com/waseemnasir2k26/n8n-workflows\"\n        style=\"color: #c66b3f; font-weight: 700\"\n        >GitHub repo</a\n      >\n      &mdash; importable JSON, MIT, free.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px\">\n      <a\n        href=\"https://workflows.skynetjoe.com\"\n        style=\"color: #c66b3f; font-weight: 700\"\n        >workflows.skynetjoe.com</a\n      >\n      &mdash; latest workflows + the video behind each one.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0 0 20px\">\n      Every automation I build on YouTube gets published as an n8n workflow JSON\n      you can import in under a minute. New workflow every video. Nothing sold,\n      nothing gated behind a course.\n    </p>\n    <p\n      style=\"\n        margin: 0 0 24px;\n        padding: 14px 16px;\n        background: #f2efe6;\n        border-left: 3px solid #c66b3f;\n      \"\n    >\n      Reply to this email with the automation you want built next.\n    </p>\n    <p style=\"margin: 0\">\n      Waseem Nasir<br />SkynetLabs<br /><a\n        href=\"https://skynetjoe.com\"\n        style=\"color: #c66b3f\"\n        >skynetjoe.com</a\n      >\n    </p>\n  </div>\n  <p\n    style=\"\n      max-width: 560px;\n      margin: 16px auto 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: #56564f;\n    \"\n  >\n    To stop these emails, reply \"stop\".\n  </p>\n</div>\n",
        "options": {
          "replyTo": "waseem@skynetlabsai.com",
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
